        "quote": "The defendant’s submissions showed that it did not create the complained-of condition (see generally Zerilli v Western Beef Retail, Inc., 72 AD3d 681 [2010]; Negron v St. Patrick’s Nursing Home, 248 AD2d 687 [1998]). The defendant further demonstrated that it had no actual or construe *1053 tive notice of the alleged condition. Regarding constructive notice, the defendant demonstrated that the alleged condition was not present for a sufficient period of time for it to have discovered and remedied the condition",
